From ec8355fe101100da5cf29b09e5686d31539d579a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r1metal <r1metal@localhost>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:38:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sound: aw87xxx: LF line ends in the parser the next patch
 changes

git am strips the CR from patch lines, so a text patch never applies
to a CRLF file. aw87xxx_bin_parse.c, which the next patch changes, gets
LF line ends and nothing else. The patch is binary for the same reason.
---
 .../soc/mediatek/aw87xxx/aw87xxx_bin_parse.c  | Bin 17170 -> 16655 bytes
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/mediatek/aw87xxx/aw87xxx_bin_parse.c b/sound/soc/mediatek/aw87xxx/aw87xxx_bin_parse.c
index 7eab9efde147673286bf6a0b5832762b2037adbe..c400554602785f92ce3be84976759bbddc2efff2 100755
GIT binary patch
